        "raw": "# Synthetic QA production guide\n\n**Standing boundaries:** No real evidence. Keep narration unchanged; mute source audio. No residential imagery in chapter 3.\n\n## Script-by-script placement\n\n### HOOK\n\n1. **At:** \u201cFirst synthetic sentence\u201d **Show:** Synthetic test pattern. **Preview:** `S03` [Preview](https://example.org/synthetic-video), around 0:01\u20130:02. **Label:** SYNTHETIC TEST PATTERN | 2026 **Care:** Technical fixture, not actual footage.\n\n### CHAPTER 1\n\n2. **At:** \u201cSecond synthetic sentence\u201d **Show:** Synthetic image. **Preview:** `S01` [Preview](https://example.org/synthetic-image). **Label:** SYNTHETIC QA IMAGE | 2026 **Care:** Not a photograph of a real person or event.\n\n## Source library\n\n- **S03 \u2014 [Synthetic video](https://example.org/synthetic-video)**  \n  Test video file; no actual evidence. **Rights:** Test-created pattern only.\n\n- **S01 \u2014 [Synthetic image](https://example.org/synthetic-image)**  \n  Test image file; no real person. **Rights:** Test-created image only.\n\n## Acquisition notes\n\nThese notes must not become part of S01's rights description.\n",
